### IPP-502 Quiz history, result detail, bookmarks and paid access tests
### How to use: run `npm run dev` in /server, then click "Send Request" above each request, top to bottom.
### Run 501-quiz.http first so there are some submitted quizzes.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Put real passwords only while testing, then put CHANGE_ME back
@adminEmail = raeeschechi302@gmail.com
@adminPassword = dingdongdingdonghilalkidingdongbubble
@userEmail = arsalmustafa62+ipp2@gmail.com
@userPassword = secret456

### Picked up automatically
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@userId = {{userLogin.response.body.data.user._id}}
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@attemptId = {{history.response.body.data.attempts[0]._id}}
@paidQuestion = {{phpList.response.body.data.questions[5]._id}}
@freeQuestion = {{phpList.response.body.data.questions[0]._id}}


### 1. Login as the normal user -> expect 200
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{userEmail}}", "password": "{{userPassword}}" }


### 2. Quiz history -> expect 200: "stats" (totalAttempts, questionsAnswered, averagePercentage, byLanguage)
###    and "attempts" newest first, each with score, total, percentage, language
# @name history
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz/history
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 3. Full result of the latest quiz -> expect 200 with "review": correct option + explanation per question
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz/{{attemptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 4. PHP questions (to get question ids for the bookmark tests)
# @name phpList
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 5. Bookmark as UNPAID user -> expect 403 "This feature needs full access..."
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks/{{paidQuestion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ---- Admin turns on paid access ----

### 6. Admin login -> expect 200
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }


### 7. Paid access ON for the user -> expect 200 "Full access turned on for ...", isPaid true, paidAt set
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/access
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isPaid": true }


### 8. Normal user tries the admin route -> expect 403 "Admin access only"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/access
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isPaid": true }


### ---- Now the user is paid ----

### 9. Bookmark a question -> expect 200 "Saved to bookmarks", "bookmarked": true
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks/{{paidQuestion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 10. Bookmark another one -> expect "bookmarked": true
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks/{{freeQuestion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 11. Bookmarks list -> expect total 2, newest first, full answers
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 12. PHP list again -> answers unlocked now, and the 2 saved questions show "isBookmarked": true
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 13. Same bookmark again = remove -> expect 200 "Removed from bookmarks", "bookmarked": false
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookmarks/{{paidQuestion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 14. Paid user starts a quiz -> expect "isSample": false and 6 questions
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz/start
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php" }


### 15. Paid access OFF again (so other tests still work as "unpaid") -> expect 200, isPaid false
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/access
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isPaid": false }
